    logits: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `half`, `bfloat16`, `float32`, `float64`.
      2-D with shape `[batch_size, num_classes]`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A `Tensor`. Has the same type as `logits`.
  "

